        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 is triggered by the family's explicit confusion about insulin dosing. The doctor actively corrects the specific misunderstanding (breakfast 14u/dinner 10u mix-up vs. actual bedtime-only 14u), reframes it as an actionable plan, and integrates it into the closure. This goes beyond generic 'ask your doctor' advice.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
