        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00557",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirms the family has completed the verification and that the plan is now fixed.",
          "quote": "您的理解和执行都非常到位，我完全同意。总结一下：今晚胰岛素固定14单位、到点打、不加不补"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 is met. The doctor initially demanded visual and document-based verification of all medications; the family later confirmed via pharmacy window and discharge summary, and the doctor explicitly forbade memory-based adjustments.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
